      "writtenOn": "2021-06-23T23:46:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think so. The old specification still uses a reserved memory region, meaning that it exists in the global array that of_reserved_mem_lookup() uses when it searches for a particular region. I believe this should work for either dynamically allocated regions or fixed ones.",
      "parentUuid": "e528c28f_6b50302e",
      "revId": "7aef62023112df662537d4e2a07d2b7f1311193e",
